{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend developer. Build a fully responsive, pixel-perfect Shopify Liquid section based on the layout, typography, colors, and content visible in image_5c8022.jpg. 
    
    The section must perfectly mimic the layout hierarchy, UI elements, and styling seen in image_5c8022.jpg. 
    
    ### 1. General Section Styles & Layout
    - Background color: Pure white (#FFFFFF) or ultra-light off-white.
    - Padding: Generous top and bottom padding, with standard responsive side margins.
    - Font Family: Use a clean, professional sans-serif (e.g., Inter, Helvetica, or custom Shopify sans-serif).
    
    ### 2. Header Block (Top Left)
    - **Eyebrow Tag:** "HOW FLOW IS DIFFERENT" in small, uppercase text. It should have a light gray background badge pill with slightly rounded corners and subtle padding.
    - **Main Heading:** "REAL-TIME CONVERSION INTELIGENCE." in bold, all-caps, large dark navy/slate blue (#0A1A2F or similar) typography. 
    - **Subheading/Description:** A block of clean, muted gray body text positioned below the heading that reads: "Flow combines accurate traffic measurement with POS integration and behavioral analytics to give you complete conversion visibility and actionable operational guidance."
    
    ### 3. Split Feature Cards (Middle Row)
    Create a 2-column horizontal grid layout on desktop that stacks vertically on mobile. 
    - **Card 1 (Left - Dark Theme):**
      - Background: Deep navy/dark slate solid color (#0E2A3A or similar) with rounded corners (~12px).
      - Icon: A small, rounded square badge in a lime/olive green shade with a subtle line chart icon inside.
      - Heading: "Accurate Traffic Measurement" in bold white text.
      - Description: "AI-powered cameras measure every customer entry with 98%+ accuracy. Staff movements are automatically excluded. You know exactly how many customers entered your store at any given time." (White text).
      - Bullet Points: Three clean checklist items with green checkmark icons:
        1. Real-time entry counting
        2. Staff exclusion active
        3. 15-minute interval updates
    - **Card 2 (Right - Light Theme):**
      - Background: Pure white or a very soft light-gray tint, featuring rounded corners (~12px) and a subtle box shadow/border to separate it from the background.
      - Icon: A small, rounded square badge in an ultra-light green tint featuring a sharp lightning bolt icon.
      - Heading: "Automatic POS Correlation" in bold dark navy text.
      - Description: "Flow connects directly to your POS system to correlate traffic with transactions. Conversion rate is calculated automatically throughout the day." (Muted gray text).
      - Bullet Points: Three clean checklist items with light green outline checkmark icons:
        1. Direct POS integration
        2. Real-time CVR calculation
        3. Historical trend comparison
    
    ### 4. Full-Width Bottom Banner (The Flow Advantage)
    - Layout: A horizontal strip spans across the bottom, resting under a soft drop-shadow separation layer.
    - Background: A very pale, light green/olive tinted banner with rounded corners.
    - Icon/Layout: On the left, a circular olive green badge featuring a concentric target/bullseye icon. 
    - Text: To the right of the icon, display:
      - **Title:** "The Flow Advantage" in bold dark text.
      - **Paragraph:** "Unlike basic people counters, Flow provides complete operational context. You don't just see conversion rate—you understand why it's changing, which stores are underperforming, and what operational adjustments will improve results." (Muted dark gray text).
    
    ### 5. Technical Shopify Liquid Structure
    - Make all text strings, colors, background options, and padding values fully customizable via Shopify Theme Editor schema settings (`settings.liquid`).
    - Code the section completely self-contained with its own `<style>` tag or Tailwind classes to prevent CSS bleeding. Ensure smooth, responsive scaling from desktop grids to single-column mobile viewports.
    
    Each content box should have an option for adding an image, the image in the boxes should top align with the icons. 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-conversion-intelligence-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.cards_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-dark-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dark_card_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.dark_card_text }};
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-light-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.light_card_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.light_card_text }};
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 200px;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-icon-dark-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dark_icon_bg }};
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-icon-light-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.light_icon_bg }};
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_text_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-checklist-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-checklist-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.checklist_font_size }}px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-checklist-{{ ai_gen_id }} li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-check-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-check-dark-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dark_check_bg }};
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-check-light-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.light_check_border }};
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-check-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.check_icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.banner_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.banner_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.banner_padding }}px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-banner-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.banner_icon_bg }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-banner-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.banner_icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-banner-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-banner-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.banner_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.banner_text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .ai-conversion-intelligence-banner-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.banner_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.banner_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-conversion-intelligence-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-conversion-intelligence-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px * 0.7);
    }

    .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .ai-conversion-intelligence-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 300px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-conversion-intelligence-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top | times: 0.6 }}px {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal | times: 0.6 }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-conversion-intelligence-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .ai-conversion-intelligence-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px * 0.5);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

